      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Bare infinitives (without 'to') are required after specific causative verbs like 'let', 'make', and 'bid' in active voice.",
        "Error detection questions frequently test confusion between Gerunds (verbal nouns) and Present Participles (verbal adjectives).",
